<P title="Backup & Disaster Recovery" intro="Backup job monitoring, routine restore tests and recovery planning around agreed business requirements." scopeHeading="What does backup verification establish?" points={points} boundary="ITKeepers routinely performs restore tests. A successful backup job alone does not prove a tested restore. Test scope, retention and recovery objectives depend on the agreed service." cta="Discuss your backup requirements"><p slot="context">Backup and recovery work connects with <a class="disclosure-link" href="/services/managed-it/">ongoing IT management</a> and <a class="disclosure-link" href="/services/cybersecurity/">security controls</a>. Monitoring a job and testing a restore answer different questions; test scope and recovery objectives must be agreed.</p><section class="section service-page-example"><h2>From a backup copy to a restore check</h2><p>Follow an example from a backup copy to a restore check.</p><Animation /></section></P>
